<title>HUNGARY: Pannonplast Q1 1997 group net income up.</title>
<headline>Pannonplast Q1 1997 group net income up.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-March 1997    Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>Group earnings before</p>
<p>     interest and taxes	    290	 vs	198</p>
<p>    Group earnings before tax    505	 vs	408</p>
<p>    Group net income		 373	 vs	338</p>
<p>    Group sales		    3,006	 vs    1,929</p>
<p>    Cost of goods sold	   2,030	 vs    1,263</p>
<p>    Gross margin		     976	 vs	666</p>
<p>    Net interest income	    194	 vs	 16</p>
<p>    Not operating items	     21	 vs	194</p>
<p>    Income tax			  68	 vs	 58</p>
<p>    Investments, minorities	 64 (loss) vs	12 (loss)</p>
<p>NOTE - Pannonplast Muanyagipari Rt is a plastics industrial group. The figures are consolidated and they were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
